                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I introduced two healthcare bills to expand affordable health insurance options for individuals, families, and small businesses struggling with healthcare costs.\n\nMy ACCESS Act reinstates the 2018 Trump administration rules for Short-Term, Limited-Duration Insurance, restoring these plans as a viable, affordable option for individuals and small businesses.\n\nThe IMPACT Act codifies a Trump administration initiative enabling marketplace access to Copper Plans, a new tier of lower-cost insurance designed to provide essential benefits and meaningful protection against catastrophic health events.\n\nToo many Americans are struggling with unaffordable premiums and limited options. I am working to fix it.",
